"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3wogQmKw729tKKWaVbZvbg","review_id":"hb8td4Mb2GHMkxvLpQdGbg","date":"2013-02-19T22:46:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9299765229225159,"text_excerpt":"YUMMY! I ate here twice during my 5 days in N'awlins! This gem in located in the French Market. They have a huge selection of hot sauces and other Southern specialties on the right side of the walk up bar seating area. While here, I tried the Alligator sausage on a stick. Very yummy and straight to the point. I dipped it into a mixture of their house made and bottled hot sauces. My combo was the Mango hot sauce mixed with Lower 9th Ward hot sauce. Very tasty indeed. On my second stop here, I tried their famous Voodoo Burger. Double Burger, Cheese, Bacon, Jalapeno slices, pickles, lettuce, & tomato. It was absolutely divine. The side of potatoes with mixed peppers was very nice as well. We..."},{"business_id":"3wogQmKw729tKKWaVbZvbg","review_id":"Wprq_eyoRBV1wFeatB4WpA","date":"2021-12-06T15:26:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9166339635848999,"text_excerpt":"if youre planning on grabbing something here, beware, there could be a wait. the prices are affordable, and the food was pretty damn good. i sat right at the counter since i was by myself. the upside down oysters are a must get. i got 6 of them. and i think they were close to $10? they were very savory. if you dont like flavor, and seasonings- then they aint for you. theyre cooked and grilled to perfection. they came out within 5 mins. the service took forever to get my actual creole breakfast bowl. i loved the sauce that was on the breakfast bowl. the cheesey grits could have been creamer. there were a few shrimp. the bowl was filling and tasty. i would only come back for the oysters, th..."},{"business_id":"3wogQmKw729tKKWaVbZvbg","review_id":"2YusWn2O_2mwzoUcXFqveA","date":"2012-11-02T18:45:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9153210520744324,"text_excerpt":"Thought this place was pretty good. Had the Creole and it hit the spot. Perfect if you're walking through the market. Food comes quick and they have seating."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3wogQmKw729tKKWaVbZvbg","photo_id":"KFMxOo1z5G30Nk1oEGG3dw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/KFMxOo1z5G30Nk1oEGG3dw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.909464418888092},{"business_id":"3wogQmKw729tKKWaVbZvbg","photo_id":"CmRcre0XYXH3lCKcgFU5sA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/CmRcre0XYXH3lCKcgFU5sA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.881460964679718},{"business_id":"3wogQmKw729tKKWaVbZvbg","photo_id":"Xu7BUkrh3IfPmEtrOQDwFA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Xu7BUkrh3IfPmEtrOQDwFA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7879374027252197},{"business_id":"3wogQmKw729tKKWaVbZvbg","photo_id":"wmNayz7W-Mj1NVBsF9Fh2w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/wmNayz7W-Mj1NVBsF9Fh2w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7586632966995239},{"business_id":"3wogQmKw729tKKWaVbZvb